    "text": "<p>Consider the following pairs of electrons</p><p>(A) (a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br />(b) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br />(B) (a)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br />(b)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br />(C) (a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br />(b)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>The pairs of electrons present in degenerate orbitals is/are</p>",
